{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06547","headline":"终南幽居献苏侍郎三首时拜太祝未上 一 · 储光羲","name":"终南幽居献苏侍郎三首时拜太祝未上 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暮春天气和，登岭望层城。\n朝日悬清景，巍峨宫殿明。\n圣君常临朝，达士复悬衡。\n道近燕艮足，归来卧山楹。\n灵堦曝仙书，深室炼金英。\n春岩松柏秀，晨路鵾鸡鸣。\n羽化既有言，无然悲不成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06547.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06547","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}